<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="QantasLetterheadUpdated" src="" style="max-width: 714.7100952148437px" title="QantasLetterheadUpdated" /><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
As a valued Platinum One member, who holds Lifetime Status recognition with Qantas, we would like to show our appreciation for your support by offering you one-time access to&nbsp;experience the Qantas Chairmans Lounge before your flight on (<strong>eg: 24th November 2023</strong>) .<br />
<br />
This invitation is for you only and will provide access to our most exclusive lounge, where you can relax, dine or work before boarding your flight from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}.<br />
<br />
If you'd like to accept our invitation, please simply respond to this email before the day of your departure and we will ensure that your details are registered with our Chairmans Lounge hosts ahead of your arrival. We look forward to hearing from you and to welcoming you at the Chairmans Lounge.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you for your continued support and look forward to hearing from you soon.</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Kind Regards,<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;<br />
Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Important Information</span></span></b><br />
<span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Due to the exclusivity of the Qantas Chairmans Lounge, this invitation is non-transferable and we're unable to extend this offer to other passengers you may be travelling with. The one-time access is valid for the flight departure listed in this email.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Access to the Melbourne Chairmans Lounge is via the escalator on the first floor, after security.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Sydney Chairmans Lounge is located in Terminal 3. Entry is via the escalator, opposite gates 4 and 5.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">To access the Canberra Chairmans Lounge </span></span><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#444444">turn right after security and enter the glass doors on the left between gates 10 and 11. Take the escalator up to the Lounge Lobby and enter the Private Lounge immediately on your left. </span></span></span>&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Brisbane Chairmans Lounge is located in the Qantas Lounge precinct, departure level 1.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Adelaide Chairmans Lounge is located opposite gate 21 on the departures level.</span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The Perth Chairmans Lounge is located on the second floor and can be accessed via the lift, after security</span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
